परि-√ या P. -याति, to go or travel about, go round or through (acc.), RV. &c. &c.;
to run through i.e. assume successively (all shapes), RV. ix, 111, 1;
to surround, protect, guard, RV.;
to avoid, shun, ib.;
to flow off (as Soma), ib. :
Caus. -यापयति (ind.p. -याप्य), to cause to go round or circumambulate, MBh.
